# DOM objects as WeakMap and WeakSet keys (cavekit-eaglercraft.md R2, T-666; engine patch 0121): render/goanna/test/
# jihad-weakmap-dom.html offers an element, WebGL objects, an AudioParam, a GainNode and a DOMRect to a WeakMap and a
# WeakSet. The engine refused the cycle-collected WebIDL objects that are not nsISupports ("cannot use the given object
# as a weak map key"), which stopped EaglercraftX 1.8.8 at its launch; every row must say ok.
id: weakmap-dom-keys
section: The engine
item: DOM objects (an element, WebGL objects, an AudioParam, a GainNode, a DOMRect) are taken as WeakMap and WeakSet keys
shells: enyo mochi mojo
prefs: jihad.compat.trace=true
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-weakmap-dom.html
kit: cavekit-eaglercraft.md R2
wait text done "rows" 30
probe rows '(function(){return document.getElementById("out").innerText.replace(/\n/g," | ");})()'
expect probe-lacks "threw"
expect probe-lacks "lost"
expect probe-has "WebGLTexture: weakmap ok, weakset ok"
expect probe-has "AudioParam: weakmap ok, weakset ok"
shoot rows
